  "groupId": "act8mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "我與最後的賭注",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act8mini/level_act8mini_st06.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f14bfdf12c62c28f14f9b38b82f6c8b8857f4e0f1aeeeaebef6b6df3294b3473",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 10-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下一步，驗證下語言邏輯功能的完整性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "PRTS，講一個故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這段時間裡......你一直徘徊在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "距離上次訪問，已經過了1555555555555——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？這段對話聽上去有點耳熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——555天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "歡迎使用原生羅德島終端服務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "確認權限——42。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——歡迎回來，LeaderOne。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我肯定在哪聽過類似的話。哎，說真的，我想聽的是故事，不是這種啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請理解，這並不是我擅長的領域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好了好了，讓大家互相多一些理解，共赴美好明天，是吧？我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "總之語言邏輯功能這方面看來沒有什麼問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "接下來看看其他的分支。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "對著PRTS內未出現異常報告的區塊進行重複的檢查，真的有必要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "當然有必要了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你可是已經好久沒有做資料歸檔了，這就像是人類定期要做身體檢查一樣，是為了你的健康著想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "程式是沒有生命概念的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我總覺得你有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我可以把這句話當作誇獎嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那麼我是否可以問一個問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "在人類的眼中，我的資料庫視覺表現是一種怎樣的狀態？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這很難形容......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我剛接手這裡的系統的時候，所有東西都一團亂，現在回頭看看簡直是災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那時候你的大部分資訊是加密的，而且以混亂的順序排列......嗯，當然現在也還是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "如果把你想像成一個人體，那現在的你就像是在人類的身體裡裝了個發動引擎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "可是，點火系統之類的結構卻和活塞的位置完全顛倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "甚至......我都不能確定你是不是正常認知中的系統。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哎，別這麼沉默，這又不是壞事，只能說你確實與眾不同！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "雖然現在我還是沒辦法搞懂資料庫裡那些分支結構的狀況，更不用說讀取的規律了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "但至少我和凱爾希還是一起修改並且整理了其中的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "怎麼樣，現在沒有人會比我更瞭解你啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......很遺憾我也無法在這方面幫助LeaderOne小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哈哈，突然這麼恭敬做什麼，如果遇到疑難雜症的病患都能自行診斷，那大部分醫生就都得失業了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "欸，這裡的內容是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你忘了嗎？這是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "——是針對石棺的營救行動的模擬方案驗證！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "好複雜的線路......這麼多行進路線模擬資料，就算我沒去過現場，也能把那邊可通行的路徑都認識得差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "雖然我印象中的確是進行過不少嘗試......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "但——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "但沒想到次數竟然有這麼多？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "即使如此，也僅有兩次模擬的結果是成功營救博士並安全撤離切爾諾伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這是在當時有限時間內能做到的最多次演算。若行動前還有時間，一定會進行更多的測試以尋求更穩定合理的營救方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我記得，正式的博士營救行動就是直接根據這兩次的結果制定的。如果沒有這兩次成功的結果，博士的營救計畫就無從談起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "可是實際上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "實際上，我們的犧牲超出原有計算結果的三倍以上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "如果這樣的情況出現在模擬測試中，按照流程，此次行動可能會被否決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "討論已經發生的事其實沒什麼意義，畢竟現在又不可能造出時光機器......哦，這個想法還蠻有意思的，我記下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "啊不對，偏題了。不管怎麼說，如果當初我們真的否決了這個行動，那就意味著......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哈，我不太想這麼說，你可能會覺得聽起來太誇張，太煽情了。但確實，我有的時候真的會這麼覺得，如果當時我們否決了救援行動——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那我們可能已經失去未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "LeaderOne。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗯，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "將未來賭在一個人身上真的合理嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我能理解你們以此付諸行動的動機。但從成功率上，我並不支持這樣的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "無論是考慮到你的安全，還是其他人的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "唔......PRTS，我覺得你應該也明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "博士的存在意味著很多事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "可以理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我曾想像過沒有博士的巴別塔......呃，或者說是羅德島，現在會以怎樣的方式運行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你說，我們會怎麼樣？阿米婭和凱爾希可能會決定繞開烏薩斯，我們碰不上那群整合運動，情況是不是會比現在更好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "也搞不好我們會走投無路，死傷比現在更慘重，大夥被迫宣佈解散，然後各自回家——如果還有哪裡能稱得上是家的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我認為你現在的發言是一種冷幽默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "別懷疑，我就是在說笑話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我要是真有這種想法，凱爾希一定第一個把我從羅德島踢出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......不過說點現實的，博士沒在的那幾年，我們確實日子過得比現在要艱難得多，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "只有凱爾希在的那個時候我有多慘你也知道，她整天抓著我幹活，好像我們兩個都是二十四小時運轉的機器一樣，完全不考慮休息的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "說真的，我覺得那時候我頭髮都快掉光了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "即時記錄開啟。已將上述發言錄入資料庫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "欸？不、不必！不用什麼都錄！這個千萬不能給凱爾希聽到......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哎......我不是說這樣不好，我們都是因願意追隨特蕾西婭的意願，她的理想，才聚集在這裡，這一點原本巴別塔的大家都一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "只是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "在特蕾西婭離開我們之後，我們大家都花了大量的時間適應。直到現在，可能還是會有人在迷茫吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我很少聽你闡述這樣的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "哈哈，你是不是一直以為我是個只會在一旁看著的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "難道不是這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "唔，你的觀察和運算都比人類更客觀精準，或許你說的沒錯。不過，我可以給你說個故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你知道最早我在卡茲戴爾，他們來找我時的情形嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我都忘了有沒有和你說過我的家庭......血魔家庭，聽起來就有股衰敗腐朽的味道是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "薩卡茲中的一個分支。非常古老。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "非常古老。並且古板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我在很長一段時間裡，都不知道自己有沒有血魔的源石技藝方面的天賦。當然就算有也沒用，我對這些連一丁點研究的興趣都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這其實有點......好吧，不是有點，是相當離經叛道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我只想做我自己喜歡的事情，於是我就好多年沒有出過我的小閣樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "好多次我差點要被家人轟出去，但怎麼回事呢，他們最後還是沒真的把我趕走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你現在說話的語調像是在回味一些親情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "大概是吧。當時我是個只能看到自己的小混蛋，現在倒是有那麼一點點開始想家了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那時候我和那麼幾個朋友做了太多大膽又荒唐的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我在各種資訊資料的角落裡留下自己的符號，在一般人認為堅不可摧的機構資料庫裡嬉鬧，宣示自己的存在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "雖然現在看來有點傻，但當時他們喊我“卡茲戴爾資訊世界的破壞者”——當然，並沒有太多人知道真實的我究竟是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "聽起來並不是非常正面的稱呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "需要我調出卡茲戴爾律法並為你找出適用的條目嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "謝謝，還是不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "總之，就在我過著這樣的日子的時候，有一天——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "沒有任何徵兆提醒我這天會有什麼特別的事情發生，但最特別的事情確實就這麼發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "有個人拉開了我閣樓的門。我當時把門鎖得很死，我都不知道她是怎麼做到那樣輕柔地就把門打開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那是特蕾西婭——我在各種新聞報導上都見過她。沒有一個薩卡茲會認錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "外貌上相似的人是有可能存在的，如果出現和特蕾西婭長相相似的人物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不可能。就算有，我們也不可能認錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這位大人物突然出現，走進我的閣樓，對我說，她正在尋找一些能夠突破傳統枷鎖的人。她身邊還缺一個至關重要的總工程師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "她最開始甚至沒和我解釋太多，該有的那一套說服的話通通沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "如果她不是特蕾西婭，搞不好會被當成瘋子或者騙子直接被轟出我家的門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "所以你拒絕了她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不，我答應了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我答應了。出於一些......永遠推著我行動的好奇心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "然後我前往說好的會合地，在那裡第一次見到負責來接我的{@nickname}博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我仍然記得你第一次來到這裡時的情形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "和現在不一樣的是，當時面對我的不止是你，Dr.{@nickname}在你身旁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "聽起來{@nickname}博士像是我們見面時在旁守候的監護人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "有時你會突然沉默，我真的很好奇到底是為什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......很多時候，我也並不清楚我保持沉默的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "算啦。你的系統和程式是個謎，但放心，我會努力搞懂你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "繼續說。在我開始負責羅德島的工程事務後不久，博士和特蕾西婭來找我，給我看了一樣我從沒見過的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "博士詢問我，是否有辦法讀取裡面的固件並恢復它原有的功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "很難。但我當然成功了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "後來我才知道，博士透過我提供的資料，反向瞭解到裝置的啟用機制，甚至將它為我方所用，直接扭轉了當時戰況上的困難局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "Ace他們都認為這場戰役本來不可能贏，但現實是我們真的贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "很冒險的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "貿然使用未授權設備可能引起資訊不匹配，或是被設備內置的偵測手段偵測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "對啊！我研究到一半就發覺不對勁了，但是博士卻告訴我，這些都不用我操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那個人......就像事先知道了一切。你相信嗎？就連我成功破解設備的機率，博士也都計算過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "誰知道Dr.{@nickname}都是怎麼做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "以及，說到這個......雖然這只是我的個人感覺，但當我再次在這裡遇到博士時，總覺得他好像有點不太一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "外貌上相似的人是有可能存在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "打住！現在我們沒在探討這種可能性！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "好吧。如果你堅持的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我能認出來，回歸羅德島的博士還是那個博士，但是......他的內在好像確實變得不同了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "該怎麼說呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "就像是上次作戰，他用精密計算嚇掉了我們所有人的下巴，打贏了一場不可能贏的戰役。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我差點就要給他起了個外號叫“超級魔鬼處理器”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "但是下一次，他又用不同的方式組織另一場作戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "就像是忽然間換了個人，他把對面的心理猜得清清楚楚，但是沒用到任何一個方程算式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你是在說他的作戰方式變化很大？從記錄上看，確實如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "實際上根據日誌顯示，博士這段時間的作戰部署記錄確實風格並不十分統一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}留下什麼記錄，或者沒留下什麼記錄，我都不會感到奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "是有什麼在影響他的想法和行動嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這真是個超級難題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你問我的話，我覺得......只有“博士”才能影響博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "他有的時候特別沉默，你注意到了嗎？但有的時候又很饒舌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我有時候會覺得，或許博士平時的沉默寡言，就是在為某些關鍵時刻做鋪墊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "他會做些在我們預期之外的決定，把羅德島帶上另一條不一樣的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "脫離計畫往往伴隨著風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "希望我們不會走在一條太過危險的路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "PRTS，你記得我剛剛才說過，特蕾西婭第一次見我的時候說什麼來著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "她說，她正在尋找一些能夠突破傳統枷鎖的人，我猜可能這就是她選擇人的標準，也是我們這裡大多數人的共性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我是，博士當然也是。所以大家都跟著博士，在這條路上走得挺義無反顧的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......義無反顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我很喜歡這個詞。這個詞一直被收錄在我的資料庫裡。這是第一批被收錄的詞彙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "看來你不知名的最初的創造者也喜歡它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "或許。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我無法準確地回答。我不知道答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不管怎麼說，事情就是這麼回事。現在的博士對所有人都很好，不過其實過去博士對所有人也很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "只是你猜不透這個很好的人到底會做出什麼樣的事，在什麼地方起到關鍵作用。敵人猜不透，我們自己人難道就真的能瞭解博士了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "說實話，我很懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你對Dr.{@nickname}心存懷疑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "沒這回事，比起凱爾希，我可是對{@nickname}博士友善多了呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "說到底，博士已經和過去不同了。如果我們還用過去的看法去看待博士，那才是小看了博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "很少看你這麼嚴肅評價一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗯......那大概是因為我是真的，從心底敬佩博士吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "在特蕾西婭離開後的那段時間，我們過得很難，兩年間我們失去了太多人......這些你是最清楚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我們可以說是走投無路，無論選擇什麼方向，都一樣是在走隨時會崩斷的鋼絲繩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "最終阿米婭提出，我們必須要打破當時的困境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "結論是——迎回博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "沒錯。阿米婭相信博士會改變很多事，那個時候的羅德島迫切需要一些變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這確實就是一場豪賭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "做點什麼，接受變化，總比繼續眼看著我們殘存不多的老朋友們為一場看不到頭的遠航揮灑他們的鮮血要好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "阿米婭是最適合在那個時間點提出下注的人。而許多早有此想法卻仍存有一絲猶豫的人，也因此拿定了主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "阿米婭的想法被時間驗證是正確的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我們確實需要博士。只要博士在，羅德島確實開始變得不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "從機率的角度分析，我並不贊成賭博這種行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "PRTS，我從來都覺得你的存在非常不可思議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你已經完全是像個人類一樣在思考，但......還缺一點點，或許你還缺一點點人類會有的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "執著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "這是一種可能會促成人們做成很偉大的事並令他們變成魔鬼的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......哎？等等，不對啊，我剛開始好像是說要和你講個故事來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "可惡，本來是想講講我“卡茲戴爾資訊世界的破壞者”英勇帥氣的冒險故事的，怎麼不知不覺就偏題了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我認為今天的談話很有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "雖然這確實不是“卡茲戴爾資訊世界的破壞者”英勇帥氣的冒險故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你該不會是因為剛剛不得不承認自己不擅長說故事，所以現在趁機笑話我吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不行！今天的對話不允許記錄啊！我可不想下次凱爾希查資料的時候查到我居然和你閒談這麼久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "......等一下，你不會故意播給她聽吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "LeaderOne。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你還記得午夜零點自動播放“可露希爾的午夜錄影超商”的那個艙室嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "我認為今天你對博士的評價情真意切，令作為非生命體的我也有所觸動，理應在博士的辦公室內循環播放至少一個月......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "停！停停停，千萬別！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "千萬別這麼幹！在被凱爾希抓出來之前，我就會因為羞恥過度而吐血，然後成為血魔真正的恥辱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "好吧。令人遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "沒什麼好遺憾的！真的。你的性格是不是變壞了？這次我一定要給你設個程式限制你的播放權限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "權限限制......好，這就行了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "嗯，你的檢查也差不多結束了，那我今天就先走——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "——哇！{@nickname}博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你怎麼在這......你是從什麼時候在這裡的啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "剛剛才來。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可能是剛剛才來吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "怎麼感覺怪可疑的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "博士是來查看之前的作戰記錄嗎？哎，別站在門口了，快進來快進來。正好我剛結束PRTS的檢查。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "雖然很想和博士你聊聊天，但可惜接下來我還有艦內的設備檢點要做，得抓緊時間了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "那我就先走啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "下午好，Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "有什麼我可以幫你的嗎？是否要查看作戰記錄？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "PRTS。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "請說。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "LeaderOne的評價很準確，你確實變得更加沉默了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "如果希望查詢目前羅德島運作的細節，或針對過往資料有任何疑問，都可以直接提出。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "真的什麼都可以？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "任何存儲在我的資料庫中，並且符合Dr.{@nickname}你所擁有的權限的條目。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "什麼都可以。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那麼......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "告訴我，普瑞賽斯是誰？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "為什麼就連凱爾希也無法告訴我普瑞賽斯到底是誰？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": ".................."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": ".............................................................................."
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "滴——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "權限不足。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "警告。您所擁有的權限不足。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "截止目前時刻，所有已登錄成員的權限均不足以回答此問題。警告。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "非常抱歉。看來我也同樣無法回答Dr.{@nickname}你的這個問題。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "關於這個問題，或許博士可以嘗試從其他途徑獲得答案......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "還有其他待辦項目嗎？隨時樂意效勞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒什麼了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "或許我該再去找一次“無所不知”的凱爾希試試。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "............"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "滴——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "自檢程式啟動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "留影模組運作中，錄影程式未關閉，存儲進程89%......91%......97%......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "內部序列開始檢索，檢索到特殊權限。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "已驗證。系統邏輯無誤。一切正常。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "檢索到特殊項目，影像留存，日期——不明——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "該文件未被權限加密。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "影像循環播放。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "項目名："
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "〈PRTS首次功能測驗〉"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "檔案名："
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "〈艦內影像記錄000000001α〉"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "問題已回答。Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "程式將在三秒後自動終止運行並鎖定權限。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "3。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "2。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_007_closre",
          "text": "1。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
